    "created_at": "2016-07-21T05:20:07Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-21T05:20:07Z",
    "body": "This is the [test case](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/attachment.cgi?id=8766029) I am talking about, or refer to https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1282894 for more details. In this case, append child fails because the child element contains the parent. So should I just rethrow the exception, even the spec does not mention throwing anything?\n\n(Yes, my first part of the sentence is what are you saying :smile: )\n",
