    "updated_at": "2016-07-22T17:01:53Z",
    "body": "Many algorithms link to the relevant DOM concepts like https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-pre-insert\n\nIf we do that here as well, it should be clear (if following references) that an exception may be thrown.\n",
