    "created_at": "2024-10-15T08:01:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-10-15T08:01:34Z",
    "body": "I believe we should consider adding error handling for cases where appending a child fails, even if the current spec only checks if the caption is an HTMLTableCaptionElement. Ensuring robust error handling can help prevent unexpected behavior and improve the overall reliability of the implementation. It might be worth discussing what specific scenarios could lead to append failures and how we should address them in the spec.",
